{
  "id": "A60",
  "goal": "INC-COORD-1118-CODEX-NATIVE-RESULT-S-001",
  "title": "Owner-private native retained results and same-goal discovery",
  "why": [
    "Exact accepted create/input run, immutable inline private Source, frozen conservative binding context privacy superset. Discovery is metadata only. Missing lookup does not prove no future commit. Execution expiry and action flags do not revoke retained reads. No managed continuation is provided by this read-only slice."
  ],
  "patch": [
